Q)Given an English sentence, write a Java program to calculate the frequency of each character in the sentence.

Example input:
Java is awesome

Expected output, preserving case and counting spaces:
J = 1
a = 3
v = 1
  = 2
i = 1
s = 2
w = 1
e = 2
o = 1
m = 1

==============
Using Java Streams Time: \(O(n)\) Space: \(O(k)\).
Using LinkedHashMap Time: \(O(n)\) Space: \(O(k)\).
Using HashMap Time: \(O(n)\) Space: \(O(k)\).
Brute force using nested loops Time: \(O(n^2)\) Space: \(O(k)\)